<title>USA: Alliance sued by Advanced Micro.</title>
<headline>Alliance sued by Advanced Micro.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Semiconductor Corp said it was served a lawsuit by Advanced Micro Devices Inc, alleging infringement of two AMD patents by certain flash memory products.</p>
<p>Alliance said it intends to vigorously defend against the action, and does not believe it will have a material effect on its financial condition.</p>
</text>
